This repository is an unofficial CLIProxyAPI provider plugin for the private
Cursor Agent v1 Connect transport. It is not affiliated with Anysphere / Cursor,
and it is not the official @cursor/sdk product (that lives in a separate
repository: cursor-sdk2api).

